  "description": "ADR-0139 D1 grounding-compliance signals (FRE-1333). Three of the four D1 signals: citation_compliance_rate and uncitable_turn_rate (both correlated, from grounding_verification_completed), and near_miss_markers.unresolved (conditional -- silence is health, no alert). observed_span_outcomes and invocation_checked_span_outcomes are deliberately NOT panelled here: both are mapped as an empty ES object with no sub-fields until FRE-1334 lands the OBSERVED tier, so a query against them cannot resolve yet. time.from is now-7d: at time of writing the corpus is a single verified turn (trace 29e778cadca6f243338f4baa7b67e8f3), so a short window reads empty despite the instrumentation being correct -- that emptiness is the corpus, not a defect in the query.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "elasticsearch",
        "uid": "es-agent-logs"
      },
      "description": "Share of citable, asserting turns where first-generation output passed grounding verification (ADR-0139 D1). Provisional threshold (green at/above 0.95, red below) pending real traffic volume -- the corpus today is a single verified turn.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.95
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.1.3",
      "targets": [
        {
          "alias": "",
          "bucketAggs": [
            {
              "id": "2",
              "settings": {
                "filters": [
                  {
                    "label": "compliant",
                    "query": "first_generation_compliant:true"
                  },
                  {
                    "label": "total_citable",
                    "query": "*"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "type": "filters"
            }
          ],
          "datasource": {
            "type": "elasticsearch",
            "uid": "es-agent-logs"
          },
          "editorType": "builder",
          "metrics": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "type": "count"
            }
          ],
          "preserveQuery": false,
          "query": "event_type:grounding_verification_completed AND turn_evidence_class:citable",
          "queryType": "lucene",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Citation Compliance Rate",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "rowsToFields",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "calculateField",
          "options": {
            "alias": "citation_compliance_rate",
            "binary": {
              "left": {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "compliant"
                }
              },
              "operator": "/",
              "right": {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "total_citable"
                }
              }
            },
            "mode": "binary",
            "reduce": {
              "reducer": "sum"
            },
            "replaceFields": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "elasticsearch",
        "uid": "es-agent-logs"
      },
      "description": "ADR-0139 D1 closure-metric sentinel: share of asserting turns (uncitable+citable) where non-exempt spans existed, tool results were offered, and none were admitted. Expected to read 0 in steady state -- any non-zero reading means a new tool landed unclassified, not that the system is unhealthy in proportion to the reading. See ADR-0139 D1.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.0001
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
